# The slice's thin Dockerfiles package only the host-built boot jars —
# keep the build context to exactly that. A repo-root context otherwise
# walks runtime data (docker/data, deployments/docker/data), demo fixtures,
# and build outputs, and fails on permission-denied files.
*
!java/
!java/synflux/
!java/synquest/
!java/synflux/build/
!java/synquest/build/
!java/synflux/build/libs/
!java/synquest/build/libs/
!java/synflux/build/libs/*.jar
!java/synquest/build/libs/*.jar
